    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.49",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸ κνύζα ἐπὶ τοῦ παρεφθαρμένου καὶ ἐρρυπωμένου ἀπὸ τοῦ κνύω, ἀφ’ οὗ κνύοϲ ἡ φθορά οἰον «κατὰ κνύοϲ ἔχευεν, ψίλωτο δὲ — κάρηνα» (Ηes. frg. XL II) γίνεται ὡϲ παρ’ Ἀνακρέοντι «κνύζη τιϲ ἤδη καὶ πέπειρα γενομένη ϲὴν διὰ μαργοϲύνην ».",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.50",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.50",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ διὰ τοῦ εια θηλυκὰ ἔχοντα ῥῆμα ἀντιπαρακείμενον διὰ τοῦ ἑῦῦ, εἰ μὴ ᾖ ἀπὸ τῶν εἰϲ μων ὀξυιόνων ὡϲ ἡγεμών ἡγεμονεύω ἡγεμονία, διὰ τῆϲ ει διφθόγγου γράφεται καὶ παροξύνετοι, ἀλαζονεύω ἀλαζονεία κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.51",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.51",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ διὰ τοῦ ια παρὰ μελλόντων γινόμενα παροξύνεται, ὀρέξω ἀνορεξία, πέψω ἀπεψία, προδώϲω προδοϲία.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.52",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.52",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ ἀπὸ ἐνεϲτώτων παρηγμένα θηλυκὰ εἰϲ εια προπαροξύνεται, ἀπόλω ἀπώλεια,μήδω λήδεια, θέρω θέρεια, θάλλω Θάλεια, ἀνθὸῶ Ἄνθεια.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.53",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.53",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἡρακλέων ὁ Γλαύκου παρὰ τὸ ἄγω φηϲίν. ἔϲτι δὲ ὡϲ παρὰ τὸ ἅρπῶ ἅρπυια, ὀρέγω ὀρέγυια.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.54",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.54",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ η καθαρὸν τῷ ο παραληγόμενα ὧν προκατάρχῃ ῥῆμα τῷ ε παραληγόμενον πάντα ὀξύνεται, ζέω ζοή, πνέω πνοή, χέω χοή.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.55",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.55",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ ω καθαρὸν λήγοντα βαρύτονα ῥήματα τὴν παραλήγουϲαν ἐν τοῖϲ ῥηματικοῖϲ ὀνόμαϲι βραχεῖαν ἔχει, κονίω κονία, φύω φυή, ἀκούω ἀκοή.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.56",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.56",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ η λήγοντα θηλυκὰ μετὰ ϲυμφώνου διϲύλλαβα ὀξύνεται τῷ ο παραληγόμενα, εἰ γένοιτο ἀπὸ ῥημάτων τῷ ε παραληγομένων μόνῳ οἱον τρέπω τροπή, τρέφω τροφή, νέμω νομή, ϲτρέφω ϲτροφή, ῥοπή, ϲπονδή ὁλκή,πλοκή,φορβή. προϲέθηκα τῷ ε παραληγόμενα μόνῳ, ἵνα νῦν ἐκφύγω τὸ πόρπη. τοῦτο γὰρ ἀπὸ τοῦ πείρω.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.57",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.57",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ βη ἰαμβικὰ ῥηματικὰ ὀξύνεται, λαβή, τριβή.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.58",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.58",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ γη διϲύλλαβα προϲηγορικὰ ὄντα καὶ ῥηματικὰ ἔχοντα τὴν πρὸ τέλουϲ ϲυλλαβὴν εἰϲ ϲύμφωνον καταλήγουϲαν ὀξύνεται οἷον φθογγή, κλαγγή, ὀργή καὶ εἴ τι ὅμοιον.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.59",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.59",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ γη ἰαμβικὰ ῥηματικὰ ὄντα ὀξύνεται, ταγή ἀπὸ τοῦ τάϲϲω, φυγή, ϲφαγή.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.60",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.60",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ εἰϲ κη ἰαμβικά, εἰ μὲν τῷ ο παραλήγοιτο, ὀξύνεται ῥηματικὰ ὄντα, πλέκω πλοκή, δέκω δοκή ἡ ὑπόνοια, πέκω ποκή τὸ ἔριον.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.61",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.61",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἡ φυλακή ἀπὸ τοῦ φυλάϲϲω ὡϲ ἰακή ἀπὸ τοῦ ἰάζω. E. M. 95, 50: τὸ δὲ ἀνάγκη εἰ ἦν ἀπὸ ῥήματοϲ τοῦ ἀνάϲϲω, ὀξύνοιτο ἂν ὡϲ ϲτενάχω ϲτεναχή.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.62",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.62",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸ ἀϊκή ὠξυτονήθη ἴϲωϲ ὅτι ῥηματικὸν ὑπῆρχεν ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀΐϲϲω ὡϲ φυλάϲϲω φυλακή, ὑλάϲϲω ὑλακή.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.63",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.63",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ διὰ τοῦ oλη ῥηματικὰ ὄντα ὀξύνεται, ϲτέλλω ϲτολή, βάλλω βολή, χέω χολή.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.64",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.64",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸ ἀλαλή ὁ θόρυβοϲ παρὰ τὸ λαλῶ.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.64.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.64.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Choer. Orth. 280, 30. ὠτειλή ἀπὸ τοῦ οὐτήϲω οὐτηλή τροπῇ τῆϲ ου διφθόγγου εἰϲ ω καὶ τοῦ η εἰϲ τὴν ει δίφθογγον Βοιωτιακῶϲ ὡϲ πένηϲ πένειϲ. λέγεται δὲ παῤ Ἀἰολεῦϲιν ὠτέλλη.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.64.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.64.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "An. Ox. II 394, 26, Arc. 110, 9. τὰ εἰϲ μη καθαρὸν ἰϲμβικὰ τὸ ο παραληγόμενα ὀξύνεται, ὁπότε προυπάρχει ῥῆμα διὰ τοῦ ε κατὰ τὴν παραλήγουϲαν οἷον νομή, ἀνατομή, προνομή.",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.67",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.67",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Αἴνη ὄροϲ Ϲικελίαϲ. παρὰ τὸ αἴθω τὸ καίω αἴτνη ὡϲ φάγω φάτνη, πήϲϲω πάχνη.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.68",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.68",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸ φωνή ἀπὸ τοῦ φωνῶ καὶ ὠνή ἀπὸ τοῦ ὠνῶ ὀξύνεται.",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.69",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.69",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸ μολπή ἀπὸ τοῦ μέλπω καὶ πομπή ἀπὸ τοῦ πέμπω ὀξύνεται.",
    "chunk_index": 68,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.70",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.70",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Χορταϲώ πόλιϲ Αἰγύπτου. ἀπὸ μέλλοντοϲ ὁ ϲχηματιϲμόϲ. ὡϲ γὰρ τοῦ καλύψω ἡ Καλυψώ, οὕτω καὶ τοῦ χορτάϲω Χορταϲώ.",
    "chunk_index": 69,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.71",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.71",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἴκρια ὡϲ δέμνια. ἔϲτι γὰρ ῥηματικόν, ὡϲ ἐν ἑτεροιϲ εἴρηται.",
    "chunk_index": 70,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.72",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.72",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "παρὰ τὸ ἀράϲϲω ἀράχνιον ὡϲ δέμω δέμνιον, παίζω παίγνιον. p. 480, 42 τὸ ἴχνιον προπαροξυτονητέον ὁμοτόνωϲ τῷ ἀράχνιον· οὐ γάρ ἐϲτιν ὑποκοριϲτικόν, ἀλλ’ ἀπὸ ῥήματοϲ ἐϲχημάτιϲται.",
    "chunk_index": 71,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.73",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.73",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸ κλιϲίον παρὰ τὸ κλείω ἐϲτίν, 5 ϲημαίνει τὸ περιέχω.",
    "chunk_index": 72,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.74",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.74",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὕψοϲ γέγονε παρὰ τὸ ὄπτω τὸ βλέπω ὄψω ὄψοϲ καὶ τροπῇ Αἰολικῇ ὕψοϲ.",
    "chunk_index": 73,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.75",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.75",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "γίνεται ἀπὸ μελλόντων ὀνόματα οὐδέτερα ὡϲ παρὰ τὸ ἅψω ἅψοϲ, πίϲω πίϲεα.",
    "chunk_index": 74,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1#tlg0087.tlg027.76",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0087/tlg027/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0087.tlg027.76",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "κνύοϲ ἡ φθορά παρὰ τὸ κνύω παρ’ Ἡϲιόδῳ ὡϲ παρὰ τὸ θύω θύοϲ καὶ φλύω φλύοϲ παρὰ Ἀρχιλόχῳ ἐπὶ φλυαρίαϲ.",
    "chunk_index": 75,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
